<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday Dun &amp; Bradstreet and MEMC Electronic Materials Inc were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA and Fruehauf Trailer Corp also were not available for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
